# The one divergence an airflow-client image takes from the base locks, and it is
# not airflowctl's: the client locks must agree with EACH OTHER (an image built
# with two client sets installs both into one interpreter -
# gateway/tests/test_toolbelt_roles.py test_client_locks_agree_with_each_other),
# and snowflake's is held below 2025.4.26 by dbt-snowflake
# (snowflake-clients.overrides). certifi is the only package DIVERGES allows.
certifi<2025.4.26
